PICO.pak
========

launch.sh is original Zlyme. It execs /usr/bin/pico8 (package/emulators/pico8).
It does not ship Pico-8. pico8_64 / pico8.dat are proprietary Lexaloffle;
the user must supply them (Bios/PICO or the Pico-8 roms folder).

Splore.p8.png is from josegonzalez/minui-pico-8-pak (MIT):
  https://github.com/josegonzalez/minui-pico-8-pak

The launch.sh follows NextUI's emu-pak layout
(https://github.com/LoveRetro/NextUI), a fork of MinUI
(https://github.com/shauninman/MinUI).

